---
source: crates/wt-agent-git/src/gateway.rs
expression: HELP
---
ag-git manages the pull or merge request for the current WT branch.

USAGE:
ag-git [COMMAND] [OPTIONS]

Run `ag-git` with no command to show the current branch, request, reviews, and CI.

COMMANDS:
open-mr [--draft]       Open or show the branch's pull or merge request
ready                   Mark the request ready for review
draft                   Return the request to draft
comment TEXT            Add a request comment
edit [--title TEXT] [--body TEXT]
review                  Show review threads and their handles
reply HANDLE TEXT       Reply to a review thread
resolve HANDLE          Resolve a review thread
reopen HANDLE           Reopen a review thread
ci                      Show CI jobs for the current commit
log JOB                 Show one CI job's log
retry JOB               Retry a CI job when the provider allows it
cancel JOB              Cancel a CI job when the provider allows it
wait                    Wait for review or CI state to change
close                   Close the request
reopen-mr               Reopen the request
help                    Show this help

Use normal Git for commits, fetches, pulls, and pushes.
